# Loaded by WXT (Vite) for `wxt build --mode development` and `wxt dev`, which
# write to .output/chrome-mv3-dev. The e2e suite loads that build so it can talk
# to a local backend; the production build in .output/chrome-mv3 keeps the
# defaults in src/config.ts and never gets these hosts.
#
# No secrets belong in this file. It is committed on purpose so the e2e suite is
# reproducible on another machine.
WXT_API_URL=http://localhost:8080
WXT_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000
